WEBVTT

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:28.530
Mom! This way! Hurry!

00:02:30.010 --> 00:02:32.000
Kentaro sure looks happy.

00:02:32.880 --> 00:02:35.310
It's his first time
going to the hot springs.

00:02:36.450 --> 00:02:39.350
Godai, hurry up!

00:02:39.980 --> 00:02:42.000
He's got no stamina.

00:03:01.070 --> 00:03:04.500
I should have stayed home.

00:03:29.030 --> 00:03:31.790
Have you no compassion?!

00:03:32.290 --> 00:03:35.700
Too bad. You lost at
"rock-paper-scissors."

00:03:36.360 --> 00:03:39.230
This sure is a run-down room.

00:03:43.750 --> 00:03:45.170
It doesn't make sense...

00:03:45.350 --> 00:03:49.640
I'm sure we pooled enough money
for a nicer room.

00:03:51.790 --> 00:03:52.950
Mrs. Ichinose!

00:03:53.450 --> 00:03:55.540
Oops. I thought it was a closet...

00:03:55.880 --> 00:03:58.040
but there's only a flimsy
sliding door between our rooms.

00:04:00.420 --> 00:04:02.350
What are you doing with
the money that's left over?

00:04:02.890 --> 00:04:05.410
It's for tonight's party.
What'd ya think?

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:10.690
Oh, dear... I knew
I should have been the treasurer...

00:04:11.070 --> 00:04:13.580
What a crappy view!

00:04:13.980 --> 00:04:16.020
I can't even see the mountains!

00:04:32.650 --> 00:04:34.700
Ms. Otonashi, look!

00:04:35.520 --> 00:04:37.710
Maybe they have a dog?

00:04:37.870 --> 00:04:39.320
Bet it's a raccoon dog.

00:04:41.130 --> 00:04:45.390
I heard the inns around here
have them as pets.

00:04:45.810 --> 00:04:49.260
Let's go to the bath before dinner.

00:04:50.380 --> 00:04:53.870
It's on the top floor of the new wing.
A bath with a view...

00:04:54.920 --> 00:04:57.180
Let's go, too.

00:04:57.950 --> 00:05:00.200
Yeah, I've worked up a sweat.

00:05:00.320 --> 00:05:02.750
Godai, it's not a coed bath, you know.

00:05:04.520 --> 00:05:05.620
I KNOW THAT!

00:05:18.530 --> 00:05:22.200
I'm glad I came, after all.
This feels great.

00:05:45.130 --> 00:05:47.020
What's Yotsuya up to?

00:05:49.030 --> 00:05:52.150
Yotsuya! Don't be a Peeping Tom!

00:05:52.810 --> 00:05:55.260
Oh, gosh! Look, Godai!

00:05:58.200 --> 00:05:58.690
Godai!

00:05:58.880 --> 00:05:59.960
Young Godai!

00:06:01.820 --> 00:06:03.010
W-What is it?

00:06:03.750 --> 00:06:05.240
Take a look at that!

00:06:05.450 --> 00:06:07.780
Here! It's incredible!

00:06:08.060 --> 00:06:09.010
W-Where?

00:06:09.630 --> 00:06:10.920
Stop it, Godai!

00:06:11.430 --> 00:06:12.760
Here. Right here.

00:06:15.930 --> 00:06:18.580
See? Amazing, huh, Godai?

00:06:19.370 --> 00:06:21.560
I...don't see a thing.

00:06:21.800 --> 00:06:23.760
Right here! Here!

00:06:26.330 --> 00:06:27.800
See? Moss.

00:06:29.200 --> 00:06:30.960
So what?! Who cares?!

00:06:31.470 --> 00:06:33.590
What did you think
you were going to see?

00:06:45.260 --> 00:06:46.470
This feels so good...

00:06:47.950 --> 00:06:49.970
-Manager...
-Yes?

00:06:50.070 --> 00:06:53.080
Let's scrub each other's backs later.

00:06:53.240 --> 00:06:54.760
Sure. Sounds great.

00:06:55.460 --> 00:06:56.860
Manager, come here.

00:06:57.940 --> 00:06:59.260
What's the matter?

00:06:59.530 --> 00:07:01.800
It's really slippery, right here.

00:07:03.010 --> 00:07:06.700
Sounds like the ladies
are having a great time.

00:07:08.180 --> 00:07:10.330
What are you, a gecko?

00:07:10.690 --> 00:07:14.080
Godai, you should talk.

00:07:14.580 --> 00:07:18.200
That's right. We all want to peep.

00:07:19.890 --> 00:07:22.860
That's why I'm resorting
to acting like a gecko...

00:07:25.090 --> 00:07:26.280
but it's not working.

00:07:26.670 --> 00:07:28.060
The moss makes it slippery.

00:07:28.130 --> 00:07:29.520
I'd like to make it clear...

00:07:29.630 --> 00:07:32.650
that I'm not stooping to acting
like a gecko or a lizard...

00:07:32.880 --> 00:07:34.570
I'm no voyeur!

00:07:34.810 --> 00:07:37.530
There's a difference between
a gecko and a lizard.

00:07:38.380 --> 00:07:41.530
A gecko is like this...
and a lizard is like so...

00:07:42.280 --> 00:07:43.070
Listen...

00:07:44.510 --> 00:07:46.630
Manager, your complexion
is so beautiful!

00:07:46.880 --> 00:07:47.710
Do you think so?

00:07:47.780 --> 00:07:49.570
So supple...

00:07:49.950 --> 00:07:52.210
Your breasts are
as perky as a teenager's!

00:07:52.320 --> 00:07:53.120
Please...

00:07:55.260 --> 00:07:58.580
You're blushing! How sexy!

00:08:00.390 --> 00:08:01.280
What?

00:08:01.700 --> 00:08:03.560
I remembered something
very important...

00:08:04.030 --> 00:08:07.770
It's possible that the baths
are connected at the bottom...

00:08:07.770 --> 00:08:10.570
Yotsuya! Stop!
Yotsuya!

00:08:10.900 --> 00:08:13.240
Don't peep from the bottom!

00:08:47.450 --> 00:08:50.500
The space is very narrow.

00:08:50.580 --> 00:08:51.970
Where's Big Brother Godai?

00:08:52.050 --> 00:08:53.440
Oh...him...

00:08:56.160 --> 00:08:58.950
Here's his leg...

00:09:04.530 --> 00:09:05.500
I'm...stuck...

00:09:07.860 --> 00:09:09.480
The bath was great.

00:09:30.560 --> 00:09:31.540
What's up with him?

00:09:31.750 --> 00:09:33.780
He almost drowned in the bath.

00:09:34.030 --> 00:09:35.110
What an idiot.

00:09:35.490 --> 00:09:37.690
I bet he was trying to peep
into the women's side.

00:09:38.800 --> 00:09:40.950
Are you all right, Godai?

00:09:44.040 --> 00:09:46.860
I should have stayed home...

00:10:01.350 --> 00:10:04.150
Sorry to keep you waiting, Soichiro.

00:10:06.590 --> 00:10:10.110
I have a treat for you tonight!
It's leftover from the New Year's feast.

00:10:10.490 --> 00:10:15.060
Sea bream, roast beef
black beans, fish roe...

00:10:15.170 --> 00:10:16.850
golden bean paste, fish cake...

00:10:18.810 --> 00:10:20.070
Don't they look delicious?

00:10:27.150 --> 00:10:30.410
I'm sure everybody's having
a feast, too, just about now...

00:10:42.990 --> 00:10:44.790
Could they be...clams?

00:10:44.990 --> 00:10:46.250
Is it me...?

00:10:46.800 --> 00:10:49.390
Or is this meal really pathetic?

00:10:49.460 --> 00:10:51.700
You're absolutely right!

00:10:51.860 --> 00:10:53.350
You're right again, Coach Mitaka.

00:10:53.600 --> 00:10:56.620
And that's why we could buy
so much alcohol!

00:10:57.240 --> 00:10:58.000
Yeah!

00:10:58.550 --> 00:11:00.090
Come on, sit down!

00:11:04.790 --> 00:11:05.310
And now...

00:11:05.480 --> 00:11:06.970
Cheers!

00:11:07.290 --> 00:11:10.310
What's the matter? Let's live it up!

00:11:10.560 --> 00:11:13.840
Yeah! Manager, you drink up, too!

00:11:14.800 --> 00:11:17.420
Godai! How about a glass?

00:11:54.640 --> 00:11:57.370
Watch, Kentaro! It's a new dance move!

00:12:08.580 --> 00:12:11.840
I feel like I never left Maison Ikkoku...

00:12:12.350 --> 00:12:13.470
You can say that again.

00:12:14.050 --> 00:12:14.920
But gosh...

00:12:16.350 --> 00:12:17.380
Kyoko...

00:12:17.660 --> 00:12:19.750
She's so sexy
in her cotton kimono!

00:12:27.370 --> 00:12:28.080
Ms. Otonashi...

00:12:29.430 --> 00:12:31.690
would you like to step out
for some peace and quiet?

00:12:31.830 --> 00:12:32.490
Uh...

00:12:32.780 --> 00:12:35.560
Manager, don't let that guy
sweet-talk you.

00:12:35.880 --> 00:12:37.240
Back off, Godai!

00:12:37.440 --> 00:12:38.090
Make me!

00:12:38.250 --> 00:12:39.930
There they go again...

00:12:40.050 --> 00:12:43.170
I don't know how they can
keep doing the same thing.

00:12:43.390 --> 00:12:46.670
Yeah.  I don't feel like
I'm at a hot spring.

00:12:46.890 --> 00:12:48.880
You should talk!

00:12:49.820 --> 00:12:52.260
All right. Why don't I bring out
the "hot springs" spirit.

00:12:58.170 --> 00:13:00.590
He-e-ey! Hey!

00:13:01.430 --> 00:13:02.900
Mr. Yotsuya?

00:13:04.300 --> 00:13:07.240
Yes. Your wish has been granted.

00:13:07.780 --> 00:13:08.760
Our wish?

00:13:33.670 --> 00:13:34.450
Snow!

00:13:34.740 --> 00:13:35.670
It's snowing!

00:13:56.220 --> 00:13:56.990
Thank you.

00:14:00.660 --> 00:14:03.080
Let's drink to the snow!

00:14:06.170 --> 00:14:08.820
Coach Mitaka! Let's get into
the "hot springs" spirit!

00:14:12.330 --> 00:14:15.240
Come on, Godai, you too!

00:14:19.280 --> 00:14:21.100
Cheers!

00:14:24.990 --> 00:14:27.040
Ms. Otonashi, look!

00:14:27.720 --> 00:14:28.990
What's the matter, Kentaro?

00:14:29.130 --> 00:14:30.080
What's the hurry?

00:14:30.550 --> 00:14:31.710
Look! There!

00:14:32.850 --> 00:14:34.440
There! There!

00:14:36.400 --> 00:14:37.320
What's up?

00:14:39.040 --> 00:14:39.920
Raccoon dogs!

00:14:41.740 --> 00:14:42.670
Aren't they cute?

00:14:44.140 --> 00:14:45.460
They sure are.

00:14:47.280 --> 00:14:48.670
Maybe they're courting.

00:14:50.300 --> 00:14:51.320
Maybe.

00:14:51.840 --> 00:14:53.010
You're probably right.

00:14:54.550 --> 00:14:56.670
Maybe they're married, Godai.

00:14:57.580 --> 00:14:59.070
You're probably right, Mitaka.

00:14:59.160 --> 00:15:00.700
Of course I am, Godai.

00:15:01.390 --> 00:15:02.780
Soichiro...

00:15:06.420 --> 00:15:08.760
I wonder if he's eaten his dinner?

00:15:20.010 --> 00:15:20.930
Soichiro...

00:15:24.970 --> 00:15:27.500
Good night, Soichiro.

00:15:36.160 --> 00:15:37.310
More, Coach?

00:15:40.590 --> 00:15:42.950
Uh... Your kimono's wide open...

00:15:44.560 --> 00:15:47.580
Oopsy! Makin' ya happy, Godai?

00:15:48.700 --> 00:15:50.960
Cover yourself, Akemi!

00:15:52.600 --> 00:15:54.400
You're turning red!

00:16:00.050 --> 00:16:01.800
Mrs. Ichinose! The door!

00:16:06.310 --> 00:16:07.970
You tore it!

00:16:08.080 --> 00:16:10.200
Are you all right, Mrs. Ichinose?

00:16:12.920 --> 00:16:14.650
Oh, dear...

00:16:14.800 --> 00:16:19.160
Geckos, lizards, geckos...

00:16:22.910 --> 00:16:23.770
Mr. Yotsuya!

00:16:24.170 --> 00:16:27.030
Godai, we won't slip this time!

00:16:27.330 --> 00:16:30.130
What is he talking about, Godai?

00:16:30.200 --> 00:16:32.800
D-Don't know.

00:16:42.820 --> 00:16:45.890
I better stay up
and keep an eye on them...

00:17:30.010 --> 00:17:33.090
You're all such slobs...

00:17:42.490 --> 00:17:45.140
Oh, boy...

00:17:52.120 --> 00:17:54.720
Kyoko, you're gonna catch a cold.

00:18:05.400 --> 00:18:06.530
Ouch...

00:18:21.850 --> 00:18:23.110
C-Cold...

00:18:51.050 --> 00:18:54.870
Kyoko... Am I...dreaming... ?

00:19:02.320 --> 00:19:04.810
This won't work.

00:19:05.470 --> 00:19:07.120
I have to change my position...

00:19:12.980 --> 00:19:15.800
Oops... I rotated the wrong way...

00:19:17.370 --> 00:19:19.560
But, even if I rotated this way...

00:19:21.140 --> 00:19:23.300
Stupid... I should just turn this way...

00:19:27.190 --> 00:19:30.550
How cruel...after all my efforts...

00:19:31.700 --> 00:19:33.590
Please turn this way!

00:19:44.270 --> 00:19:46.380
C-Can't breathe...

00:19:52.050 --> 00:19:54.060
Mom! Gotta pee!

00:19:54.610 --> 00:19:55.740
Why, you little...!

00:20:01.960 --> 00:20:02.910
Is it her shampoo?

00:20:07.090 --> 00:20:08.490
Back off, Godai!

00:20:14.390 --> 00:20:17.410
Damn the guy... Sleep talking?

00:20:26.020 --> 00:20:27.210
Yeah. Serves you right!

00:20:29.720 --> 00:20:31.680
She's sleeping so soundly...

00:20:34.080 --> 00:20:35.130
She's so cute.

00:21:14.730 --> 00:21:15.780
Sorry about all that.

00:21:26.300 --> 00:21:30.320
M-Manager...?

00:21:32.110 --> 00:21:33.660
Soichiro...

00:21:59.680 --> 00:22:01.540
Oh, well...

00:22:45.410 --> 00:22:48.510
Coach Mitaka, what's
the matter? Hangover?

00:22:48.580 --> 00:22:50.710
No... I had a bad dream.

00:22:52.230 --> 00:22:55.310
Manager, who'd you buy
those goodies for?

00:22:55.890 --> 00:22:57.910
They're for your husband.

00:22:58.000 --> 00:23:00.190
You didn't have to do that.

00:23:00.270 --> 00:23:01.550
Let's eat them!

00:23:01.630 --> 00:23:02.430
No!

00:23:04.060 --> 00:23:06.350
Oh! Did you lose at
"rock-paper-scissors" again?

00:23:06.480 --> 00:23:07.860
Me? Yeah.

00:23:13.020 --> 00:23:13.740
What is it?

00:23:13.910 --> 00:23:15.370
Nothing.

00:23:18.080 --> 00:23:19.130
Let's go.

00:23:19.880 --> 00:23:20.280
Sure!

00:23:31.470 --> 00:23:33.550
I'm glad I came, after all.

00:23:50.140 --> 00:23:53.460
Godai, did I just
hear you yell "dumb ass"?

00:23:54.000 --> 00:23:55.760
Tell me what happened!

00:23:56.500 --> 00:24:00.760
Next: "Fractured Godai
Bedside Chance at Love"

00:24:01.210 --> 00:24:04.880
It was all my fault.
It's my duty to take care of you!
